# Atlas Core Component Design Token Specification
**Author:** Halo Marlow  
**Department:** Design  
**Project:** Atlas Core  
**Produced:** D12 03:30  
**Inputs used:** Business Document (Company Document)  
## Summary

Production-ready W3C-compliant component design tokens for project Atlas Core, strictly mapped from brand fundamentals defined in Company Document to service SaaS and Face-to-Face touchpoint interfaces.

## Deliverable
```
{
  "$schema": "https://design-tokens.github.io/community-group/format/",
  "metadata": {
    "project": "Atlas Core",
    "author": "Halo Marlow (Design - Data Purist)",
    "sourceDocument": "Company Document",
    "sourceUsage": "Extracted brand accessibility thresholds (WCAG AAA 7:1 for text), dense data grid row specifications, and dual-mode tactile touch targets (48px F2F kiosk vs 32px SaaS compact) from Company Document."
  },
  "component": {
    "button": {
      "primary": {
        "background": {
          "$value": "{color.brand.primary.600}",
          "$type": "color",
          "$description": "Derived from Company Document section 3.2 brand primaries."
        },
        "text": {
          "$value": "{color.neutral.000}",
          "$type": "color"
        },
        "padding-y": {
          "compact": { "$value": "8px", "$type": "dimension" },
          "default": { "$value": "12px", "$type": "dimension" },
          "f2f-kiosk": { "$value": "16px", "$type": "dimension" }
        },
        "border-radius": { "$value": "{radius.sm}", "$type": "dimension" }
      }
    },
    "card": {
      "surface": {
        "$value": "{color.surface.layer-1}",
        "$type": "color"
      },
      "border": {
        "$value": "1px solid {color.neutral.200}",
        "$type": "stroke"
      },
      "elevation": {
        "$value": "{elevation.subtle}",
        "$type": "shadow"
      }
    },
    "input": {
      "height": {
        "compact": { "$value": "32px", "$type": "dimension" },
        "f2f": { "$value": "48px", "$type": "dimension" }
      },
      "focus-ring": {
        "$value": "2px solid {color.interactive.focus}",
        "$type": "stroke"
      }
    }
  }
}
```